  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So, at the moment you can grab a Phys Bone with one hand but can't continue to grab it with the other hand. What I mean by this is that when you grab a Phys Bone with your right hand and want to continue to grab it with your left hand, you always need to put it in pose mode first and then switch the hands.\nMy suggestion would be to transfer the bone to the hand which is now trying to grab it. So that when I hold it with my right hand, I can just grab it with my left hand and continue to move it around.",
